WEBVTT

01:38.056 --> 01:41.851
Someone like Hajime Nagumo,
who abandons others with no hesitation.

01:41.935 --> 01:43.436
Why do people idolize him?

01:44.229 --> 01:46.147
It's almost like he's a hero.

01:48.566 --> 01:52.028
The real hero is supposed to be me.

01:52.112 --> 01:55.532
I don't… I don't think that!

01:55.615 --> 01:56.950
Stop spouting nonsense!

01:57.617 --> 01:59.536
Don't try and fool yourself.

01:59.619 --> 02:00.912
I am you.

02:00.995 --> 02:03.665
I know better than anyone else.

02:04.666 --> 02:05.834
Shut up!

02:07.710 --> 02:09.671
You seem awfully shaken.

02:10.171 --> 02:13.424
Nagumo took the time
to derust the Holy Sword, too.

02:13.508 --> 02:16.052
You're letting that treasure go to waste.

02:17.595 --> 02:21.850
Or is it because you resent
and envy Nagumo so much,

02:21.933 --> 02:24.227
that you'd rather not
use it to its fullest?

02:24.310 --> 02:26.396
None of that's relevant here!

02:26.479 --> 02:30.191
I don't resent… Nagumo…

02:31.985 --> 02:35.071
You're so quick to turn
a blind eye to the truth.

02:35.155 --> 02:39.742
That's why I grow stronger yet… again!

02:44.205 --> 02:47.125
You can't stand how strong Nagumo is.

02:47.208 --> 02:51.296
His strength should have
belonged to you, am I right?

02:53.840 --> 02:57.844
Or rather, you can't stand
anything about him.

02:57.927 --> 02:59.304
You're wrong.

02:59.387 --> 03:02.640
Nagumo may have a selfish streak to him,

03:02.724 --> 03:04.475
but he's saved me countless times.

03:05.310 --> 03:08.813
I would never think that
about someone like him!

03:08.897 --> 03:10.273
Hey now.

03:10.356 --> 03:15.111
When he saved you, you felt more
envy than gratitude, did you not?

03:15.194 --> 03:21.075
You were jealous because gallantly
rushing in to save people is your job.

03:21.159 --> 03:22.744
There's no way!

03:22.827 --> 03:24.829
That's not right at all!

03:24.913 --> 03:26.372
Not right?

03:28.791 --> 03:31.419
Then how come
I'm the one getting stronger?

03:42.931 --> 03:45.934
T-Take flight! Celestial Flash!

03:46.017 --> 03:48.811
Gather. Heavenstrum.

03:51.105 --> 03:53.316
Deflect! Divine Armor!

04:01.199 --> 04:03.034
You want to crush him, don't you?

04:03.117 --> 04:04.494
Nagumo, that is.

04:04.577 --> 04:08.831
Make him kneel,
and admit that I'm in the right!

04:08.915 --> 04:13.878
Then save the world, bring everyone back
with me, be showered with praise…

04:13.962 --> 04:15.672
Shut up!

04:17.382 --> 04:19.801
Nope, I won't stay quiet.

04:23.388 --> 04:25.723
Not hesitating to aim for my neck.

04:25.807 --> 04:28.059
I thought murdering humans was evil.

04:28.142 --> 04:30.061
You're no human!

04:35.942 --> 04:37.402
What's the matter?

04:37.485 --> 04:39.362
You're consumed by bloodlust.

04:41.906 --> 04:43.324
Say, Hero.

04:43.992 --> 04:47.829
If you act like that,
someone else might leave you.

04:47.912 --> 04:49.706
Wh-What are you…

04:49.789 --> 04:52.458
Stop pretending you haven't noticed.

04:52.542 --> 04:57.338
The fact that I've noticed it
means that you have, too.

04:57.422 --> 04:59.173
That's enough! Shut up!

04:59.841 --> 05:02.635
Who does Shizuku have eyes for?

05:04.804 --> 05:06.597
Don't even want to think about it?

05:06.681 --> 05:09.559
Not only Kaori, but even Shizuku…

05:11.561 --> 05:12.812
Die!

05:15.857 --> 05:19.360
C'mon.
Is that something a hero should say?

05:20.903 --> 05:26.868
And scream all you want, but the truth is
that Shizuku has feelings for Nagumo.

05:37.045 --> 05:39.213
You refuse to accept it?

05:40.048 --> 05:42.884
You'd go so far as to
deny Shizuku's feelings.

05:44.510 --> 05:47.513
That can't possibly be true…

05:48.639 --> 05:51.642
Not in a million years…

05:53.478 --> 05:55.104
You really can't believe it?

05:56.898 --> 05:58.858
What splendid timing.

05:58.941 --> 06:00.193
You think you've won this?!

06:00.276 --> 06:03.154
Okay, time to get a taste of reality.

06:03.237 --> 06:05.114
What are you talking about?!

06:12.789 --> 06:14.415
Your trial's still going?

06:20.379 --> 06:21.339
Nagumo…

06:22.632 --> 06:23.758
Damn you…

06:34.685 --> 06:38.439
So? What's the big idea, Amanogawa?

06:41.025 --> 06:43.152
The hell… What the hell…

06:43.236 --> 06:45.696
Huh? I can't hear you.

06:45.780 --> 06:49.450
Anyway, you're not up against us,
but the one back there…

06:49.534 --> 06:50.868
Us?

06:50.952 --> 06:54.956
Why are you putting a wall
between me and you two?

06:55.039 --> 06:56.874
Shizuku doesn't belong to you.

06:56.958 --> 06:58.209
Are you playing games with me?

06:58.292 --> 07:01.796
Stop being stupid
and put an end to this already.

07:01.879 --> 07:03.172
The enemy's on the other side.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.883
Yeah, I'll put an end to this!

07:05.967 --> 07:11.139
I'll end it all, whether
you tell me to or not!

07:11.222 --> 07:14.142
Tsk, you succumbed to it?

07:14.225 --> 07:15.226
What an idiot.

07:15.309 --> 07:16.477
Shut up!

07:16.561 --> 07:19.730
Everything will go back
to normal if you go away!

07:19.814 --> 07:21.691
So go away already!

07:23.359 --> 07:25.278
Whoa there.

07:25.361 --> 07:27.238
Calm down, Amanogawa.

07:27.321 --> 07:29.073
You don't want Yaegashi to die, do you?

07:29.157 --> 07:30.825
You coward!

07:30.908 --> 07:32.285
Let go of Shizuku!

07:35.538 --> 07:36.831
What?

07:36.914 --> 07:39.834
How can you be half-asleep
at a time like this?

07:39.917 --> 07:43.463
If you don't wake up right now,
I'll turn you into a human cannonball.

07:46.424 --> 07:48.259
Celestial Flash!

07:50.470 --> 07:52.555
You're out like a light!

07:52.638 --> 07:54.098
Real shameless of you.

07:54.182 --> 07:56.893
I-I'm not shameless…

07:56.976 --> 07:59.937
It's just that your back feels so nice…

08:00.021 --> 08:02.899
Well, you're not the issue here.

08:02.982 --> 08:05.776
More importantly, do something about him.

08:08.905 --> 08:10.781
Wait, this situation…

08:10.865 --> 08:13.493
What's going on? Huh?

08:15.870 --> 08:18.039
Looks like he's succumbed.

08:18.122 --> 08:21.000
He thinks I'm the root of all evil.

08:22.001 --> 08:23.085
No way…

08:25.880 --> 08:27.715
Koki! Don't!

08:27.798 --> 08:30.009
You mustn't lose to the other you!

08:30.092 --> 08:32.929
Return to your senses
and overcome yourself!

08:33.012 --> 08:34.722
It's okay.

08:34.805 --> 08:37.767
Shizuku, I'll make sure I rescue you.

08:37.850 --> 08:39.894
Koki, what are you saying?

08:40.561 --> 08:43.064
Nagumo's brainwashed you, right?

08:43.731 --> 08:47.068
It's okay.
Defeating him should undo it all.

08:47.151 --> 08:48.528
What?

08:49.111 --> 08:52.240
Nagumo… We may be former classmates,

08:52.323 --> 08:55.576
but don't think you can get away
with hurting my childhood friend.

08:58.246 --> 08:59.580
I'll take you down,

08:59.664 --> 09:04.126
and undo the brainwashing
on Kaori and all the other girls!

09:04.210 --> 09:08.422
Then, I'll save the world with their help!

09:08.506 --> 09:10.716
Koki, snap out of it!

09:10.800 --> 09:11.968
Don't be deceived!

09:12.718 --> 09:13.928
Shizuku…

09:14.679 --> 09:16.222
Listen to me, Koki.

09:16.305 --> 09:19.892
Facing the worst parts
of yourself hurts a lot.

09:21.686 --> 09:26.148
But accepting and surpassing them
is the only way to move forward.

09:26.232 --> 09:30.444
If you want to save lots of people,
you can't cling to convenient ideas.

09:32.822 --> 09:34.782
Your enemy here is yourself…

09:35.575 --> 09:38.035
The other Koki grinning over there!

09:38.119 --> 09:39.245
Open your eyes!

09:41.497 --> 09:42.999
Thanks, Shizuku.

09:43.499 --> 09:47.295
You're always earnestly thinking of me.

09:48.254 --> 09:49.505
Koki.

09:50.172 --> 09:51.757
I'm really happy.

09:52.300 --> 09:56.512
You're brainwashed,
but you still care so much about me.

09:57.722 --> 09:58.931
Koki?

09:59.015 --> 10:00.266
It'll be fine.

10:01.100 --> 10:04.228
I'll take down that demon
who shares my face,

10:04.312 --> 10:06.689
and save you from Nagumo as well.

10:06.772 --> 10:11.402
You'll no longer need to stay
by someone you don't even like!

10:11.485 --> 10:12.695
Koki…

10:24.165 --> 10:25.541
Stop it, Koki!

10:30.463 --> 10:32.298
Wait! I'll stop him!

10:32.381 --> 10:33.758
To your right, Yaegashi.

10:38.971 --> 10:41.223
I'll handle Shizuku.

10:41.307 --> 10:44.727
You go and fight
with your hated foe all you like.

10:47.730 --> 10:50.650
Wh-Why, you! Get away!

10:50.733 --> 10:53.110
All he can see is Hajime Nagumo.

10:53.194 --> 10:56.822
The fate of the trial
rests with Hajime Nagumo now.

10:56.906 --> 10:59.325
-Don't you interfere.
-Who are you to decide?!

11:01.118 --> 11:02.745
You're okay with this?

11:02.828 --> 11:05.873
Your precious childhood friend
is being attacked.

11:05.956 --> 11:07.792
He's still me.

11:07.875 --> 11:08.959
He wouldn't kill her.

11:09.043 --> 11:12.421
Didn't you just call him a demon?

11:12.505 --> 11:16.425
He's a demon who's copied
my emotions to mimic me, right?

11:16.509 --> 11:19.887
So even though he's a demon,
he wouldn't kill Shizuku.

11:19.970 --> 11:22.014
You're not making any sense.

11:22.098 --> 11:23.682
Prepare yourself.

11:23.766 --> 11:26.560
I won't let you do as you like any longer!

11:26.644 --> 11:29.105
Shizuku, Kaori, Yue, and the rest!

11:29.188 --> 11:31.065
I'll free them all!

11:35.069 --> 11:39.782
Nothing's more pointless
than calling a true idiot what he is.

11:40.491 --> 11:43.160
But I will still say this.

11:44.912 --> 11:50.751
Who gave you permission
to talk about my girls so casually? Huh?!

12:07.685 --> 12:08.894
Nagumo!

12:10.729 --> 12:12.440
Please stop!

12:12.523 --> 12:14.525
I'll talk some sense into Koki!

12:18.529 --> 12:21.157
Let's have Shizuku stay out of this.

12:27.913 --> 12:31.208
Go on, me. It's hero time.

12:32.835 --> 12:36.797
Rescue the heroines from the bad guy.

12:36.881 --> 12:39.008
I won't do as you say!

12:39.091 --> 12:41.218
I'm just using you for now!

12:42.052 --> 12:47.141
Don't forget that after
I defeat Nagumo, it'll be your turn!

12:59.737 --> 13:00.613
It's no use.

13:09.371 --> 13:10.998
Did the two of you fuse?

13:11.707 --> 13:16.921
I'd rather not, but I'll resign myself
for the sake of defeating you.

13:17.546 --> 13:19.965
Though I'll be defeating him after this.

13:20.049 --> 13:21.675
You moron.

13:21.759 --> 13:24.053
All you did was give in to temptation.

13:24.136 --> 13:26.347
Babble on all you like.

13:26.430 --> 13:29.934
No matter what you say,
you can't defeat me.

13:30.851 --> 13:33.145
Not with this power welling up inside me!

13:33.229 --> 13:36.398
That's the reason you ended up this way.

13:36.482 --> 13:38.484
Why won't you realize that?

13:38.567 --> 13:39.610
Enough of your talk!

13:40.236 --> 13:41.779
Get ready, Nagumo!

13:42.571 --> 13:45.074
Limit Break: Overload!

13:55.459 --> 13:56.293
You can't be…

14:12.017 --> 14:13.811
Did you go easy?

14:14.812 --> 14:16.689
Are you mocking me?

14:17.606 --> 14:22.570
If I killed you, Yaegashi, Kaori,
and the others would be sad.

14:23.320 --> 14:27.157
The aftermath of killing you would be
more annoying than if I didn't.

14:27.241 --> 14:28.909
Don't mess with me!

14:28.993 --> 14:31.370
I'll rob you of that composure right now!

14:33.998 --> 14:35.541
Don't you…

14:35.624 --> 14:39.128
Don't you talk like you know everything!

14:39.211 --> 14:41.338
I'll be the one to save this world!

14:41.922 --> 14:45.092
I'm a hero, which makes me
the most just of them all!

14:45.676 --> 14:47.052
It's not you!

14:47.136 --> 14:49.263
There's no way it could be you!

14:50.222 --> 14:52.558
You're like a little kid
throwing a tantrum.

14:53.309 --> 14:54.435
If only…

14:55.102 --> 14:57.021
If only you would go away…

15:07.239 --> 15:08.991
You're nothing but a murderer!

15:09.074 --> 15:10.618
You abandon others with no hesitation!

15:11.201 --> 15:12.828
You're a terrible person!

15:14.121 --> 15:16.040
There's no need for you anymore!

15:25.674 --> 15:28.510
Yue, you and the others were safe?

15:28.594 --> 15:30.554
Yeah, we're fine.

15:30.638 --> 15:32.640
That said, what's with that idiot?

15:33.390 --> 15:37.019
To sum things up,
he lost to his own false image,

15:37.102 --> 15:39.396
bought into his own convenient delusions,

15:39.480 --> 15:41.607
so now he's taking out his anger on me.

15:42.232 --> 15:46.570
What's more, he absorbed his own
false image to raise his latent power.

15:47.613 --> 15:49.281
What a hopeless man.

15:49.907 --> 15:54.036
If he manages to return
to his senses, he'd clear the trial…

15:54.119 --> 15:55.329
But that won't happen.

15:55.412 --> 15:58.874
Yaegashi tried to talk him out of it,
and this is where we ended up.

15:59.458 --> 16:03.128
Kaori. I don't think she's in
critical condition, but heal her anyway.

16:03.212 --> 16:05.881
O-Of course! Leave it to me!

16:13.347 --> 16:15.975
So you're all here.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.143
Wait just a little longer.

16:18.686 --> 16:22.606
I'll take him down and free all of you.

16:22.690 --> 16:24.692
What are you saying, Koki?!

16:24.775 --> 16:27.528
What's gotten into you?! Come back to us!

16:27.611 --> 16:29.446
Koki, snap out of it!

16:29.530 --> 16:32.449
The one you need to defeat isn't Nagumo!

16:32.533 --> 16:34.451
It's yourself!

16:35.202 --> 16:38.998
Don't tell me Ryutaro and Suzu
have been brainwashed, too…

16:39.748 --> 16:41.875
How rotten can you get?!

16:41.959 --> 16:43.877
I'll make you atone for your sins!

16:43.961 --> 16:48.716
That idiocy of yours
is just as deadly of a sin.

16:51.510 --> 16:54.138
We can't just wait for
you every single time.

16:54.680 --> 16:57.099
Damn it! You coward!

17:01.061 --> 17:03.647
-Wait, Nagumo!
-Nagumo, don't do it!

17:03.731 --> 17:04.606
Nagumo!

17:25.085 --> 17:27.004
What in the world happened?

17:27.087 --> 17:29.548
M-My power is fading…

17:30.132 --> 17:31.091
It can't be…

17:31.800 --> 17:35.471
I haven't gotten anyone back yet…

17:49.318 --> 17:50.986
Please, Nagumo.

17:51.862 --> 17:56.033
Give me back all the things
that should be mine.

17:56.116 --> 17:57.493
Please, just die!

18:01.163 --> 18:04.625
Go start your life over from scratch.

18:05.334 --> 18:06.835
You complete moron.

18:10.756 --> 18:14.343
-Hajime!
-Yep, it's Hajime.

18:14.426 --> 18:17.137
What's wrong, Yue?
Did the trial take its toll on you?

18:17.971 --> 18:21.100
Looks like all of you managed
to make it out in one piece.

18:21.183 --> 18:24.019
-Well, let's get going.
-W-Wait, wait!

18:24.103 --> 18:25.938
We need to heal Koki!

18:31.110 --> 18:34.029
You said he absorbed his false image?

18:34.113 --> 18:39.368
Perhaps that's the reason why his spirit's
taken quite a lot of damage.

18:41.161 --> 18:43.831
I'll need to take
some time to look after him.

18:43.914 --> 18:47.334
You don't need to fully heal him.

18:47.417 --> 18:49.461
Just make sure he doesn't die.

18:49.545 --> 18:52.506
At the very least, don't let him
regain consciousness.

18:52.589 --> 18:53.882
Huh?

18:53.966 --> 18:55.884
Oh, sure.

18:55.968 --> 18:58.053
Would that be for the best?

18:58.637 --> 19:02.808
Nagumo, I know Koki
caused you a lot of trouble…

19:03.475 --> 19:04.977
But, well…

19:05.519 --> 19:06.770
Nagumo…

19:06.854 --> 19:08.397
Listen here.

19:08.480 --> 19:12.067
Think about how much of a pain
he'll be if he's fully healed.

19:12.151 --> 19:13.485
A pain?

19:14.069 --> 19:18.365
Remember,
Amanogawa didn't clear the trial.

19:18.448 --> 19:21.952
He turned a blind eye to reality,
and took it out on me.

19:22.578 --> 19:24.913
That won't change even if he wakes up.

19:24.997 --> 19:27.916
He's lucky just to be alive, huh?

19:28.500 --> 19:32.254
Ryutaro. Once he's healed up,
can you carry Koki on your back?

19:32.337 --> 19:33.630
Sure thing.

19:34.548 --> 19:37.968
In the end, Koki's the only one
who didn't manage it.

19:38.051 --> 19:41.513
-He won't be happy about that…
-Yeah.

19:41.597 --> 19:43.182
But it's okay!

19:43.265 --> 19:45.726
As long as he stays alive,
he can keep trying again and again!

19:46.977 --> 19:47.811
Yep!

20:01.074 --> 20:03.994
Nagumo, thanks for everything.

20:05.495 --> 20:07.789
-This is to thank you.
-Yaegashi?

20:07.873 --> 20:13.128
A-Also, it's proof that what I said
back there wasn't a joke!

20:17.716 --> 20:21.011
Yue. Shea. Tio. Kaori.

20:22.346 --> 20:26.016
During this trial,
I came to realize a lot of things.

20:26.099 --> 20:29.353
My own bad habits,
and the feelings I have now.

20:29.436 --> 20:31.063
Shizuku.

20:31.772 --> 20:36.568
He has Yue and the others,
and most of all, my best friend likes him.

20:36.652 --> 20:38.362
I know it's awful of me.

20:39.488 --> 20:40.530
Still…

20:40.614 --> 20:41.949
It's okay.

20:42.032 --> 20:44.284
I don't think it's awful at all.

20:44.368 --> 20:46.453
I mean, it's how your heart feels!

20:46.536 --> 20:48.247
There's nothing you can do about that!

20:49.790 --> 20:54.670
More importantly, you always
used to place others before you,

20:54.753 --> 20:57.589
but now you're being true to yourself.

20:57.673 --> 20:59.258
That makes me happy.

20:59.925 --> 21:01.176
Kaori…

21:03.679 --> 21:04.596
Indeed.

21:04.680 --> 21:07.683
I'm in love with Nagumo.

21:07.766 --> 21:10.143
So I'll do everything I
can for my own sake.

21:12.271 --> 21:13.355
Let's get going.

21:40.799 --> 21:44.136
Looks like we didn't
get split up this time.

21:44.219 --> 21:46.096
Yeah. And look at that.

21:46.179 --> 21:49.641
Looks like we've finally made it.

21:49.725 --> 21:51.435
What a beautiful building.

21:52.686 --> 21:55.397
Could that be the palace?

21:55.480 --> 21:57.441
No doubt about it.

21:57.524 --> 22:00.360
We're in the deepest part
of the ice caves.

22:00.444 --> 22:02.904
The hideout of Vandre Schnee.

23:35.956 --> 23:39.543
<i>Next time, "The Key to the World".</i>
